    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener><dateline><date when="1950-01-26">January 26,
                        1950</date></dateline><salute>Dear <rs type="person"
                            ref="#tillich_person_id__1928">Professor Tillich</rs>:</salute>
                </opener>
                <p>We are trying to call in all our overdue book reviews for the JOURNAL OF
                    RELIGION, and we find that we have not yet received your reviews of the
                    following books:<lb/><rs type="person" ref="#tillich_person_id__5498"
                        >Cullmann</rs>: <hi rend="u"><rs type="work" ref="#tillich__CG3UIZ3V"
                            >Christus und die Zeit</rs></hi><lb/><rs type="person"
                        ref="#tillich_person_id__5497">Mehl</rs>: <hi rend="u"><foreign
                            xml:lang="fra"><rs type="work" ref="#tillich__32RD3B9V">La Condition du
                                Philosophe Chretien</rs></foreign></hi><lb/>Would it be possible for
                    you to give us these reviews in time to meet our next deadline at the Press,
                    which is <date when="1950-02-15">February 15th</date>?<note type="ea">In <q>The
                            Journal of Religion</q> lassen sich keine Rezensionen Tillichs zu den
                        genannten Werken ausfindig machen.</note> Thank you for giving this your
                    attention.</p>
                <closer><salute>Sincerely yours,</salute><signed><hi rend="hand"><rs type="person"
                                ref="#tillich_person_id__5496">Eulalia Williams</rs></hi><lb/><rs
                            type="person" ref="#tillich_person_id__5496">(Mrs.) Eulalia
                            Williams</rs><lb/>Editorial Secretary</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
